{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09110","headline":"和张舍人夜直中书寄吏部刘员外 · 韦应物","name":"和张舍人夜直中书寄吏部刘员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西垣草诏罢，南宫忆上才。\n月临兰殿出，凉自凤池来。\n松桂生丹禁，鸳鹭集云台。\n托身各有所，相望徒徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}